<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">PHM</para>
  <para style="toc2">PHM</para>
  <para style="toc3">PHM</para>
  <para style="mt">PHM</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">Uwasika u Bulus korwa pa pilimon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Gya Bulus, an aba pare zwama Kristi Yesu na Timoti buhun abuci, Kurwa pa Pilimon a'osa na a'osa ai ibwana ana ga̱ci ka̠ri, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na Afiya buhun bu cu'a abuci, na Arkibus buhun abuci pa ibwana i ci soja na alagano an sa amatanaga na yaba nibui: <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />I burya̠ i sa nibui na dulacumi soo an a sere pa Hwinsu Buca a buci na Buca̱ bu taba Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanlo na itano i soo i pilimon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Buhunwo Pilimon, ka̠mu hon na gya na i ahunda si mabuturage gya goji Hwinsu, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />zwama na huge itano i soo nebo pa Bugwama Yesu na maka̠la̠ amabwe pa alagano a nagu eewo. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Ahunda̠ namui pa go ube igamuwu i siwa nici pa ibwana i cikarigo ci Hwinsu, ui kole idaku i burya̠ dinya ina gaci za pa Kristi. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Maka̠la̠ amabwe ma san na hoge laco dinya tare na koce u hawungurumi, zwama goo, buhun a bumui, bu sano hasuwa halagano hana haza eewo suwa u cene.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus u iyi una zwama Onisimus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Zwama haruni, na za ihoge iwasa ko mu'eya mu gya na hyen an go ea ina goo bu ka̱ri ea, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />ama zwama gya na bu ka̱ri, na ginbo na bu o'na. Gya Bulus bu'onga hinda baniya buna aba pare hinda ani tane na okaba u ci'incu zwama Kristi Yesu- <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Na yiwa na bu o'na zwama bwa a bumui Onisimus, buna bu gya na hin hona aba na pare. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Na da Onisimus bui zanuwa anpani, a pamui ama baniya buza anpani apahin na apamui. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Na yiwa na cuma bo-ahwaboi baniya bu-suwa numui uba yiwa pa buba. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Na ginbo i kumgaga bware apamui, an tane na ukaba u ci'incu zwama izwamago i cikarigo ci laco, inga buba bwe na taimaka maimako noboi. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ko inga uba sa, na kanruwo u bu sana inga dole goo na ia̠ burya̠; ama, na ginbo go i na iyajo i suwa nibui. Na za ea ihya kwa bo yaje. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Kila Onisimus u bu curi cimu wahyan u ma rigiya zwama goo ce bware ina iza ihogu. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ta ca bware inga busa bugyama, ama bu zake haruni bugyama: ama ca bware inga buhun buna goo bu ka̠ri na kristi. na ka̱ri bware dinyiya! Harbuni goo ma, inga bugyama na buhunwo buna bu yiwa na Bugwama bu doone. <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Sa bo na zangi na sa a'osa nabo a ibwana na Kristi, ca bware na wa̠wo inga gyamui goo bui na ca. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Sa bware bu ia̱gi ina ya kamacuwa ko bu lagano utase u ihya, gyamui na cupe. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Gyamui, Bulus, na yiwa na rubuci ina na wa numui. Gya na cupe-naza i rubya an na lagano utase. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Na ginbo, buhun, na yiwa na bu una ina egyi i burya̠ zwama Hwinsu; ina san suwa u cene na Krista. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Na daki bwe ea ina gya na hyen go ea, na rubuci, zwama na daki bwe ea hal ma zakai ina gya na hyen goo ea. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Hal baniya: Na kimgage ukaba u hanyagata, zwama na daki Hwinsu ui cane anhunda nahin una ringiya ahwahin.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bungagu ui ihogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Abaparas, ana a yiwa na ukaba u ci'incu tare na gya zwama Yesu Kristi, a yiwa na sangana. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Na sa'osa sa ibwana nimui, Markus, Aristarkus, Demas na Luka a yiwa na bu buganga. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />I burya̠ i Hwinsu na nu burya̠ Yesu kristi a yan tare na anhunru nahin. Harbuni.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>